# jQuery vs TypeScript: The Ultimate Comparison

> **TL;DR:** jQuery wins for rapid DOM manipulation and browser compatibility; TypeScript wins for scalable, type-safe JavaScript development.

## At a Glance Comparison

| Feature/Spec | **jQuery** | **TypeScript** |
| :--- | :--- | --- |
